## ✍ DM Response
In the twilight of Avalon, the air hangs heavy with an otherworldly chill that seeps into your very bones, a reminder of the land's ancient and potent magic. The reeds surrounding the standing pool sway ominously, whispering secrets to those who would listen closely enough.

As you approach the door in the reeds, its presence seems to grow stronger, pulsating with a rhythm that matches your heartbeat. With each step you take towards it, you feel more connected to this mystical place, as if the land itself is reaching out to claim you.

The parchment in your hands glows brighter with every step, the two words etched upon its surface shimmering like stars against the night sky. You can almost hear them calling out to you, urging you to take the next step and cross into the realm beyond.

With a deep breath, you recite the words aloud, your voice echoing through the silence. The air around you crackles with energy, the world around you warping and shifting as if time itself is bending to your will.

The door in the reeds swings open, revealing a path that stretches out into the darkness. You step through it, feeling the ground beneath you shift from soft mud to smooth stone. The world around you changes, the night sky above replaced by a vast cavern ceiling adorned with crystals that catch the dim light and cast prismatic patterns upon the walls.

A sense of awe washes over you as you take in your new surroundings. You have stepped through the veil, leaving Avalon behind for a land unknown, its mysteries waiting to be uncovered. But with each step you take into this strange realm, you cannot help but feel that you are not alone. Unseen eyes watch from the shadows, whispering promises and threats in equal measure.

You have much to learn, Sioned ferch Cai. The path before you is fraught with danger, but also with great power. Only time will tell whether you will emerge victorious or fall into the abyss.

## 📋 Summary
In Avalon's twilight, Sioned ferch Cai crossed a magical threshold by reciting ancient words on a glowing parchment, stepping from mud to stone and entering an enchanting cavern, unveiling a new realm filled with mystery and unseen watchers, her fate uncertain yet promising great power.
